• Greatly increased damage: {(Damage + 4) \times 2}

• [Before Repentance] Tears down: {(Delay \times 2.1) + 3}

• [Repentance] Tears fired per second * 0.42.

• If a tear kills an enemy and has left over damage, the tear travels on with the remaining damage.

• Grants a chance of increasing damage by 1.8 for the current room upon taking damage.

• The chance depends on the luck stat, and the formula used to determine the chance is: [Before Repentance+] \frac1 { 5 - \left \lfloor \mathit{Luck} \times 0.5\right \rfloor}

• • At 0 luck the chance is 20%, maxing out at 100% at [Before Repentance+] 8 / [Repentance+] 16 luck.

